msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Rediģēt izvēlnes struktūru kā JSON. Katram vienumam var būt: name, icon, "
"command (izpilda caur čaulu) vai action (sesijas darbība: lock, logout, "
"leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (vienumu "
"masīvs) vai separator (true)."

